#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:106
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plasma is an easy-to-use desktop environment made by the KDE community.  "
"This desktop provides a suite of applications with a consistent look and "
"feel, a standardized menu and toolbars, keybindings, color-schemes, "
"internationalization, and a centralized, dialog-driven desktop configuration."
msgstr "Plasma 是由 KDE 社区开发的易用桌面环境。它提供一套外观和使用体验一致的应用程序，以及标准化的菜单和工具栏、键盘快捷键、配色方案、国际化支持和集中式的对话框驱动桌面配置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:109
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"More information on Plasma can be found at the link:https://kde.org/plasma-"
"desktop[Plasma homepage].  For FreeBSD-specific information, consult the "
"link:https://freebsd.kde.org/[FreeBSD homepage at KDE]."
msgstr "有关 Plasma 的更多信息，请参阅 link:https://kde.org/plasma-desktop[Plasma 主页]。有关 FreeBSD 的特定信息，请参阅 link:https://freebsd.kde.org/[KDE 上的 FreeBSD 主页]。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:111
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "To install the package:"
msgid "Install Plasma meta package"
msgstr "要安装套件可："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:114
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install the Plasma desktop with a basic set of KDE Applications, execute:"
msgstr "要安装带有一组基本 KDE Applications 的 Plasma 桌面，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:118
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install kde\n"
msgstr "# pkg install kde\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:122
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Additional KDE Applications are tagged with the `kde-applications` "
"category.  Search for them by executing the following command:"
msgstr "其他 KDE Applications 带有 `kde-applications` 分类标签。执行以下命令即可搜索这些应用程序："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:126
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% pkg search -S origin kde-applications\n"
msgstr "% pkg search -S origin kde-applications\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:129
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Minimal Plasma installation"
msgstr "最小化安装 Plasma"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:132
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "To install the package:"
msgid "To install a minimal Plasma desktop, execute:"
msgstr "要安装套件可："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:136
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install plasma6-plasma\n"
msgstr "# pkg install plasma6-plasma\n"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:142
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This installation is *really* minimal.  The Konsole terminal emulator must "
"be installed separately executing:"
msgstr "此安装确实非常精简。必须另外安装 Konsole 终端模拟器，执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:146
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install konsole\n"
msgstr "# pkg install konsole\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:150
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configure Plasma"
msgstr "配置 Plasma"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:154
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Plasma uses man:dbus-daemon[1] for a message bus and hardware abstraction.  "
"This application is automatically installed as a dependency of Plasma."
msgstr "Plasma 使用 man:dbus-daemon[1] 提供消息总线和硬件抽象功能。此应用程序会作为 Plasma 的依赖项自动安装。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:156
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable the D-Bus service in man:rc.conf[5] to start at system boot:"
msgstr "在 man:rc.conf[5] 中启用 D-Bus 服务，使其在系统启动时运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:160
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:248
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:299
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:373
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:439
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:505
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc dbus_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc dbus_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:163
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Start Plasma"
msgstr "启动 Plasma"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:167
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The preferred way to start Plasma is automatically via the package:x11/"
"sddm[] display manager.  To install package:x11/sddm[], execute:"
msgstr "推荐通过 package:x11/sddm[] 显示管理器自动启动 Plasma。要安装 package:x11/sddm[]，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:171
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:516
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install sddm\n"
msgstr "# pkg install sddm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:174
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable the SDDM service in man:rc.conf[5] to start at system boot:"
msgstr "在 man:rc.conf[5] 中启用 SDDM 服务，使其在系统启动时运行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:178
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:523
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc sddm_enable=\"YES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc sddm_enable=\"YES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:181
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A keyboard language, in this case Spanish, can be set in SDDM with the "
"following command:"
msgstr "可以使用以下命令在 SDDM 中设置键盘语言，此处以西班牙语为例："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:185
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:530
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# sysrc sddm_lang=\"es_ES\"\n"
msgstr "# sysrc sddm_lang=\"es_ES\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:189
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Alternatively, start Plasma in an Xorg session is by manually invoking man:"
"startx[1].  For this to work, the following line is needed in ~/.xinitrc:"
msgstr "也可以在 Xorg 会话中手动调用 man:startx[1] 来启动 Plasma。要使其正常工作，需在 ~/.xinitrc 中添加以下行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:193
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% echo \"exec dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 ck-launch-session startplasma-x11\" > ~/.xinitrc\n"
msgstr "% echo \"exec dbus-launch --exit-with-x11 ck-launch-session startplasma-x11\" > ~/.xinitrc\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:196
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Experimentally, start Plasma manually in a Wayland session by executing the "
"following command:"
msgstr "目前可以在 Wayland 会话中通过执行以下命令手动启动 Plasma："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:200
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "% exec dbus-launch ck-launch-session startplasma-wayland\n"
msgstr "% exec dbus-launch ck-launch-session startplasma-wayland\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:207
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GNOME is a user-friendly desktop environment.  It includes a panel for "
"starting applications and displaying status, a desktop, a set of tools and "
"applications, and a set of conventions that make it easy for applications to "
"cooperate and be consistent with each other."
msgstr "GNOME 是一种易于使用的桌面环境。它包含用于启动应用程序和显示状态的面板、桌面、一组工具和应用程序，以及一套约定，使应用程序能够轻松协作并保持一致。"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:209
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "To install the package:"
msgid "Install GNOME meta package"
msgstr "要安装套件可："

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:212
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install the GNOME meta package with GNOME Desktop and Applications, "
"execute:"
msgstr "要安装包含 GNOME 桌面和应用程序的 GNOME 元软件包，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:216
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install gnome\n"
msgstr "# pkg install gnome\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:219
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Minimal GNOME installation"
msgstr "最小化安装 GNOME"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:222
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To install the GNOME-lite meta package with a GNOME desktop slimmed down for "
"only the basics, execute:"
msgstr "要安装 GNOME-lite 元软件包，以获取仅包含基本功能的精简 GNOME 桌面，请执行："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:226
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "# pkg install gnome-lite\n"
msgstr "# pkg install gnome-lite\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:229
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Configure GNOME"
msgstr "配置 GNOME"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:233
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GNOME requires `/proc` to be mounted.  Add this line to `/etc/fstab` to "
"mount this file system automatically during system startup:"
msgstr "GNOME 要求挂载 `/proc`。将以下行添加到 `/etc/fstab`，以便在系统启动时自动挂载此文件系统："

#. type: delimited block . 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:238
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:364
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:430
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:495
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid ""
"# Device                Mountpoint      FStype  Options         Dump    Pass#\n"
"proc                    /proc           procfs  rw              0       0\n"
msgstr "# Device                Mountpoint      FStype  Options         Dump    Pass#\nproc                    /proc           procfs  rw              0       0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:242
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GNOME uses man:dbus-daemon[1] for a message bus and hardware abstraction.  "
"This application is automatically installed as a dependency of GNOME."
msgstr "GNOME 使用 man:dbus-daemon[1] 提供消息总线和硬件抽象功能。此应用程序会作为 GNOME 的依赖项自动安装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:244
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable D-BUS service in `/etc/rc.conf` to start at system boot:"
msgstr "在 `/etc/rc.conf` 中启用 D-BUS 服务，使其在系统启动时运行："

#. type: Title ====
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:251
#, no-wrap, fuzzy
msgid "Start GNOME"
msgstr "启动 GNOME"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:255
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"GNOME Display Manager is the preferred display manager for GNOME.  GDM is "
"installed as part of the GNOME package."
msgstr "GNOME Display Manager 是 GNOME 推荐使用的显示管理器。GDM 随 GNOME 软件包一同安装。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:257
#, fuzzy
msgid "Enable GDM in `/etc/rc.conf` to start at system boot:"
