"filename]#/usr/local/bin/chromium#."
msgstr "Chromium 的可执行文件是 [.filename]#/usr/local/bin/chrome#，而不是 [.filename]#/usr/local/bin/chromium#。"

#. type: delimited block = 4
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:642
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Available search engines in Chromium are region-locked.  Refer to the "
"section on crossref:l10n[using-localization, Using Localization] to "
"configure an appropriate locale."
msgstr "Chromium 中可用的搜索引擎受地区限制。请参阅 crossref:l10n[using-localization, 使用本地化] 一节，了解如何配置适当的区域设置。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/books/handbook/desktop/_index.adoc:649
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Iridium is a free, open, and libre browser modification of the Chromium code "
"base, with privacy being enhanced in several key areas.  Automatic "
"transmission of partial queries, keywords, metrics to central services is "
"inhibited and only occurs with consent."
msgstr "Iridium 是对 Chromium 代码库进行修改的自由开源浏览器，在多个关键方面增强了隐私保护。未经用户同意，不会自动向中心服务传输部分查询内容、关键词和指标；只有在获得同意后才会进行此类传输。"

